s7-6-p36 = prose (cons "The containing-image, decoder, loader, and resource premises from §9.3 remain in \(P\) or the block's contextual hypotheses. For a guarded source fixpoint \(p=\mathsf{fix}(\lambda\,\mathsf{self}.\mathsf{body}(\mathsf{self}))\), a target loop can realize one turn of \(\mathsf{body}\) by finite blocks and return to the loop entry by a backward branch. **If** those blocks re-establish \(P\) and supply a guarded step of the relation from a delayed hypothesis, the turn proof has type \(\triangleright\mathsf{Sim}\to\mathsf{Sim}\); guarded fixed-point (Löb) induction closes the back edge. Neither a backward jump nor the source fixpoint by itself establishes the simulation: the one-turn proof, handler correspondence, and invariant do the work." nil)
